cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite the GLOBESINK data paper and the dataset
  (see preferred-citation and references), and this software by its Zenodo DOI.
  This release (v1.1) is the processing code behind GLOBESINK dataset versions 1.0 and 1.1
  (concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.19558503) and the ESSD data paper.
type: software
title: "GLOBESINK: MATLAB processing code for the GLOBESINK BGC-Argo particle size and POC flux climatology"
authors:
  - family-names: Briggs
    given-names: Nathan
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1549-1386"
    affiliation: "National Oceanography Centre, Southampton, UK"
repository-code: "https://github.com/natembriggs/GLOBESINK-code"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Biogeochemical-Argo
  - optical backscattering
  - particulate organic carbon
  - POC flux
  - particle size
  - biological carbon pump
version: "v1.1"
date-released: "2026-11-16"
# the Zenodo software DOI is added after the release mints it (task D2)
